(Thanks, everyone. The tremendous demand for our computing platforms, NVIDIA RTX, NVIDIA HPC, ) Tj
T*
(and NVIDIA AI, drove a great quarter, capping a record year. Our work propels advances in AI, ) Tj
T*
(digital biology, climate sciences, gaming, creative design to autonomous vehicles and ) Tj
T*
(robotics, and some of today's most impactful fields. Our open computing platform optimized ) Tj
T*
(across the full stack, architecture for data center scale is adopted by customers globally ) Tj
T*
(from cloud to core to edge and robotics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(I am proud of the NVIDIA operations team as we make substantial strides in broadening our ) Tj
T*
(supply base to scale our company and better serve customer demand. And this year, we ) Tj
T*
(introduced new software business models with NVIDIA AI Enterprise, NVIDIA Omniverse, and ) Tj
T*
(NVIDIA DRIVE. NVIDIA DRIVE is a full-stack end-to-end platform that serves the industry with ) Tj
T*
(AV chips, data center infrastructure for AI and simulation, mapping, and the autonomous ) Tj
T*
(driving application service. Our data center infrastructure is used by just about anybody ) Tj
T*
(building AVs, robotics robotaxis, shuttles, and trucks.) Tj
